; "Resize…" window. A preset: MenuTitle, %1 - its size ("50%", "1920x1080", "to width 1920")
[Resizer]
MenuTitle=Size %1
Width=to width %1
Height=to height %1
FieldWidth=Width
FieldHeight=Height
FieldPercent=Percent
Auto=auto
LiveEmpty=Enter a size to build a menu item
ModeFit=Fit
ModeFill=Fill
ModeCrop=Crop
ModeFitTip=The whole picture fits into the size
ModeFillTip=The picture covers the size, the extra stays
ModeCropTip=The picture covers the size, the extra is cut off
